Run locally
1) Get the code

Option 1: Download ZIP

Open the repo on GitHub

Click Code → Download ZIP

Unzip the folder

Option 2: Clone (if Git is available)
git clone <REPO_URL>
cd care-companion-ai-workshop-CSUEB

2) Create a virtual environment

Mac/Linux:

python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

Windows PowerShell:

python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

3) Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
4) Start the app
streamlit run app.py

A local URL will appear in the terminal. Open it in the browser.
